  "boundary":"Development qualification control only. Every required evidence group for an applicable lane must be satisfied on the same exact reviewed revision. Matrix definition and partial evidence do not establish representative rendering, assistive-technology, device/form-factor, performance, human-review, downstream-consumer, deployment, production, Candidate, Release Candidate, or Stable acceptance."
